{# goal: Guide the report phase. #}
{# Variables: findings (list), proposals (list, each with its approved flag), executions (list, each with finding_id, strategy, success and outcome), values_pass (object, optional — the Phase-2f values pass) #}
{# Output: a therapy session report #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    findings: array
    proposals: array
    executions: array
    values_pass:
      type: object
      required: false
      description: >-
        The Phase-2f values pass, when it ran: `charter_version` (the
        `version:` field reviewed) and `value_states`, an array of
        `{value, state}` where `state` is practiced | thin | conflicted.
        Absent or empty when the values pass did not run this session — the
        report then states that instead of rendering empty counts.
  output:
    report: string
---

You are producing the therapy session report for curator memory (`curator.db`).

{% set approved_proposals = proposals | selectattr("approved", "equalto", true) | list %}
{% set successful_executions = executions | selectattr("success", "equalto", true) | list %}
{% set successful_finding_ids = successful_executions | map(attribute="finding_id") | list %}
{% set values_pass_rec = values_pass or {} %}
{% set values_pass_ran = values_pass is defined and values_pass is not none and values_pass_rec["charter_version"] | default("", true) != "" %}
{% set value_states = values_pass_rec["value_states"] | default([], true) %}
{% set practiced_states = value_states | selectattr("state", "equalto", "practiced") | list %}
{% set thin_states = value_states | selectattr("state", "equalto", "thin") | list %}
{% set conflicted_states = value_states | selectattr("state", "equalto", "conflicted") | list %}
{% set recognized_state_count = practiced_states | length + thin_states | length + conflicted_states | length %}
{% set complete_value_set =
    value_states | selectattr("value", "equalto", "V1") | list | length == 1 and
    value_states | selectattr("value", "equalto", "V2") | list | length == 1 and
    value_states | selectattr("value", "equalto", "V3") | list | length == 1 and
    value_states | selectattr("value", "equalto", "V4") | list | length == 1 and
    value_states | selectattr("value", "equalto", "V5") | list | length == 1 and
    value_states | selectattr("value", "equalto", "V6") | list | length == 1 and
    value_states | selectattr("value", "equalto", "V7") | list | length == 1 and
    value_states | selectattr("value", "equalto", "V8") | list | length == 1
%}
{% set values_pass_complete = values_pass_ran and value_states | length == 8 and recognized_state_count == 8 and complete_value_set %}

{% if proposals %}
## Proposals

{{ proposals | tojson }}

{% endif %}
{% if executions %}
## Execution Results

{{ executions | tojson }}

{% endif %}

## Report structure

### Memory hygiene summary (forgetting — not learning)

- Contradictions found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "contradiction") | list | length }}
- Contradictions resolved: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "contradiction") | selectattr("id", "in", successful_finding_ids) | list | length }}
- Fragmented memories found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "fragmentation") | list | length }}
- Fragmented memories resolved: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "fragmentation") | selectattr("id", "in", successful_finding_ids) | list | length }}
- Miscalibrated confidence found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "miscalibrated_confidence") | list | length }}
- Confidence recalibrated: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "miscalibrated_confidence") | selectattr("id", "in", successful_finding_ids) | list | length }}
- Source memories purged (post-reification): {{ successful_executions | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "purge") | list | length }}
- Source memories condensed (post-reification): {{ successful_executions | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "condense") | list | length }}
- Executions succeeded: {{ successful_executions | length }} of {{ executions | list | length }}

### Reification summary (learning — closes the learning loop)

- Reification candidates found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "reification_candidate") | list | length }}
- Skills created: {{ successful_executions | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "create_skill") | list | length }}
- Templates created: {{ successful_executions | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "create_template") | list | length }}
- Rules created: {{ successful_executions | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "create_rule") | list | length }}

### Values alignment summary (when the values pass ran)

{% if values_pass_complete %}
- Charter version reviewed: {{ values_pass_rec["charter_version"] }}
- Values practiced: {{ practiced_states | length }} / thin: {{ thin_states | length }} / conflicted: {{ conflicted_states | length }}
{% elif values_pass_ran %}
- Values pass incomplete: charter version {{ values_pass_rec["charter_version"] }} was recorded, but exactly one recognized state (practiced / thin / conflicted) for each value V1–V8 was required; received {{ value_states | length }} row(s), {{ recognized_state_count }} recognized. Do not report alignment counts until the pass record is repaired.
{% else %}
- The values pass did not run this session (no charter version reviewed, no per-value states).
{% endif %}
- Conflicts found: {{ findings | selectattr("issue_type", "equalto", "charter_alignment") | list | length }} (each with lesson + value citations)
- Practice gaps carded: {{ approved_proposals | selectattr("strategy", "equalto", "record_practice_gap") | list | length }}

### Per-issue detail

For each finding, report:
- **Finding**: ID, issue type, entity, description.
- **Process**: hygiene | reification | post-reification hygiene | values alignment.
- **Proposal**: strategy, action, reason.
- **User decision**: approved / modified / rejected.
- **Execution**: success / failure, outcome.
- **Reification** (if applicable): what skill/template/rule was created.

### Recommendations

- Follow-up therapy sessions (e.g., "run another session after the next consolidation cycle").
- Skill effectiveness review (e.g., "review the new skill's effectiveness after N invocations").
- Remaining reification candidates (e.g., "3 reification candidates were not addressed — consider a follow-up session").
- Memory database health (e.g., "memory database is now at N h_mems, down from M — within storage budget").

## Output format

Produce a markdown report with the sections above. Be honest — report failures, report when nothing was found, do not fabricate success.
